<title>ITALY: Stefanel H1 '96 pretax loss 19.3 bln lire.</title>
<headline>Stefanel H1 '96 pretax loss 19.3 bln lire.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Group consolidated results</p>
<p>    Turnover				 251.3  vs  down 51.2</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			     19.3  vs  1.8 profit</p>
<p>    Shareholders equity		  203.7  vs  190.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Stefanel is an Italian textile group.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
